  "prompt": "For each month of 2025, Voltmarkt's average net revenue per store: the net revenue (net_revenue_eur in sales, by sales.order_date, the UTC day) of the stores open on every day of that month, divided by the number of those stores. A store is open on every day of a month when opened_on is on or before the month's first day and close_date is missing or on or after its last day; a store that opened or closed during a month is left out of that month, its revenue and its count alike. A store open all month with no sale counts with 0. The webshop counts as a store. Round to 2 decimals with ROUND. Return three columns, in this order: month_start (the first day of the month), stores_open and revenue_per_store. Return one row for each month of 2025. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "month_start",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "stores_open",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "revenue_per_store",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": null
  },
